.TH SPEEDLINE 1
.SH NAME
speedline \- drawing program whose pen thickens with speed
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/speedline
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I SpeedLine
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Graphics/Speedline.HC
drawing program.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Draw with the left button held.
For every pointer movement the pen thickness is set to
0.04 times the pointer speed, so a slow careful stroke is a hairline
and a fast flick is a fat one.
That is the whole idea of the program.
.PP
The right button offers the sixteen palette colours; click one to draw
in it, or press a key to keep the current colour.
Any key clears and exits.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF "right button"
.TP
.B "left button"
Draw
.TP
.B "right button"
Choose a colour
.TP
.B "any key"
Clear and exit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/speedline.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
